<title>CHINA: Shinhan Bank opens China city branch.</title>
<headline>Shinhan Bank opens China city branch.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Shinhan Bank has opened a branch in China's northeastern city of Tianjin, the official Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The branch was intended to boost financial cooperation with the port city, the agency said but gave no details.</p>
<p>Tianjin was a major investment destination for many large South Korean companies, it said.</p>
</text>
